    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classConfigManager" kindref="compound">ConfigManager</ref> class manages the application configuration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manages the application configuration from a config.ini file. Applies the <bold>Singleton</bold> pattern to ensure only one globally accessible instance exists, providing a centralized point to access program options. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
